  "title": "Emily's Pickled Eggs",
  "description": "Pickled eggs are a wonderful condiment to have on hand, and they're easy to make with this recipe. Ready in just three days, they make a nice holiday gift!",
  "authors": [
    "Cheryl"
  ],
