  "ingredients": [
    "12 large eggs",
    "1 cup white vinegar",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "1 medium onion, sliced",
    "2 tablespoons coarse salt",
    "2 tablespoons pickling spice",
    "5 black peppercorns"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7Pyqp0_7LIouxfr78LBOaQouGW0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-92433-emilys-pickled-eggs-DDMFS-step-1-e24da034e451446399123254206d7185.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/92433/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place eggs into a large pot and cover with cold water. Bring water to a boil, then immediately remove from the heat. Cover the pot and let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iSgoRdJ7sZdsMcPLwqHNxbL4sI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-92433-emilys-pickled-eggs-DDMFS-step-2-16b0e4fa004f49348875bf39d3d722bd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/92433/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer eggs to a strainer and run under cold water for 1 minute. Return eggs to the pot; fill with cold water and let sit until cool enough to handle, 2 to 3 minutes. Peel eggs and place into a 1-quart, wide-mouth jar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qy1LH42iAIkIlRZPNd8hYQLpAi0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-92433-emilys-pickled-eggs-DDMFS-step-3-04493300a76f4735931442d8958bdb09.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/92433/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine vinegar, water, all but a few slices onion, salt, pickling spice, and peppercorns in a saucepan. Bring to a rolling boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/or1QIosMZpjQ09mY6yJy7xKDz0k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-92433-emilys-pickled-eggs-DDMFS-step-4-7ccc7e738a014f8eb6af5f41fe38fb16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/92433/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over the eggs in the jar. Place remaining onion slices on top and seal the jar. Cool to room temperature, about 1 hour, then refrigerate for 3 days before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JqvCd1NqLRimbtpMEaKwpgqJSJw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-92433-emilys-pickled-eggs-DDMFS-step-5-0e0df9f2b2bb47838df62f2e0f93e49b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/92433/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
